# Title: Suspicious PowerShell Invocation From Script Engines
# ID: 95eadcb2-92e4-4ed1-9031-92547773a6db
# Status: test
# Level: medium
# Author: Florian Roth (Nextron Systems)
# Date: 2019-01-16
# Tags: attack.execution, attack.t1059.001
# Description: Detects suspicious powershell invocations from interpreters or unusual programs
# Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

(((parent_name:*\\wscript.exe OR parent_name:*\\cscript.exe) AND (process_name:*\\powershell.exe OR process_name:*\\pwsh.exe)) AND -((CurrentDirectory:*\\Health Service State\\*)))
